          "explanation": "Option B is correct because the lecture explicitly states that balance sheet variables (assets, liabilities, equity) are stock variables, often stated as \"as of 31st March 2026.\" Income statement variables are flow variables, stated as \"for the year.\" Option A is incorrect as they are different variable types. Option C reverses the definitions. Option D is incorrect as income statement variables are flows.",
