          "question": "Explain the difference between specific risk and market risk, using the professor's exact examples (pilot strike and global financial crisis/COVID-19 pandemic). In your answer, explain whether each risk type can be eliminated by diversification and why a well-diversified portfolio primarily carries market risk.",
          "marks": 10,
