          "front": "According to the lecture, what is the risk with family loans that have no interest and no repayment date?",
          "back": "While normal in family businesses due to the interplay between family and firm, these loans create implicit subsidies and risk shifts that require monitoring to ensure they do not harm the business or minority shareholders."
