          "explanation": "The lecture explicitly states: 'The real barrier... is that there seems to be a lot of resistance from the senior generations and it is not the absence of talent or rules themselves.' Option B matches this finding. Option A is the distractor trap the lecture specifically warns against. Option C is factually incorrect regarding the Indian regulatory context discussed. Option D misrepresents the focus of the barrier analysis.",
