          "id": 1,
          "question": "Explain the three-circle governance framework of a family firm as discussed in the lecture. How does the framework address the risk of the \"dinner table becoming the boardroom\"? In your answer, distinguish between the governance concerns of the family room, the boardroom, and the owner room, and explain why governance must be established prior to scaling.",
