          "id": 4,
          "question": "An analyst uses a 2x2 matrix framework to assess a strategic decision. The analyst forgets that the framework compresses hundreds of variables into four quadrants and presents the four-quadrant result as the complete truth about the decision. This error best illustrates which concept?",
