          "question": "A Hyderabad logistics app failed during a peak festival period. A manager claims it was caused by external cyberattacks from competitors. A Tarka-style inquiry finds normal external traffic in the logs and identifies database log issues during peak order volume as the likely cause. What is the primary purpose of using Tarka in this scenario?",
