          "front": "Why does Tarka discipline the imagination and prevent rushing toward dramatic but unsupported explanations?",
          "back": "Tarka tests claims by tracing their consequences against observable evidence. If the evidence does not match the assumed consequences (e.g., cyberattack claim but normal traffic logs), the claim is weakened. This prevents accepting stories that are exciting but unsupported by data."
