          "id": 1,
          "question": "An investor bids for Rs. 2,000 worth of shares in an underpriced IPO. Due to overwhelming demand, the allotment is only 25% of the bid amount. If the IPO yields an immediate 20% return on the allotted shares, what is the rupee gain for the investor?",
