          "question": "You are evaluating two startup job offers. Startup A has a product that users rate as 8/10 efficiency, while the best alternative they have used previously was 5/10. Startup B has a product rated 7/10 efficiency, with the previous alternative also rated 7/10. Using the Delta 4 framework discussed in the lecture, which startup offers a more stable long-term opportunity for a new employee? Justify your answer with reference to the lecture's concepts regarding user retention and founder honesty.",
