          "id": 1,
          "question": "Using the Trend E dashboard requirements as a case study, explain how a designer should apply the principle of progressive disclosure to manage the complexity of the operations page, which requires comparing order cycle times across fulfillment centers, showing on-time delivery percentages by carrier and region, and tracking return rates. In your answer, discuss the specific chart types recommended for each metric and how the progressive disclosure mechanism resolves the overwhelm issue.",
