          "question": "In the TrendE case study, a dashboard project encountered a refresh frequency mismatch where marketing wanted returns data refreshed by the 1st of the month, but the logistics system only provided updates on the 7th of the month due to external partner dependencies. What is the appropriate action according to the lecture?",
