          "front": "Why is a stacked bar chart preferred over a pie chart when visualizing composition with many categories?",
          "back": "The human eye is better at comparing bar lengths (linear distance) than pie chart angles (radial distance). Research shows \"position beats angle,\" making bar length comparison more accurate and less error-prone when slices exceed 4."
