              "front\"": "What is the primary risk of an uninformed exit from ownership in a family business?\",\n      \"back\": \"Loss of stability for family members and turmoil among assets, even if professionals manage the business, as seen in the Sanjay Kapoor incident.\"\n    },\n    {\n      "
