          "question": "Using the 5Cs framework (characters, context, conflict, choices, consequences), construct a counter-reading of Uber's dominant narrative from the perspective of its drivers. How does changing the central character and measure of success alter the moral of the story? (10 marks)",
          "marks": 10,
