          "id": 1,
          "question": "Based on the Zepto case study discussed in the lecture, explain why relying on a single dimension (such as documented equity settlements or public valuation) is insufficient to determine if a startup is a healthy place to join. In your answer, reference the specific cultural signals mentioned in the lecture that may be hidden from external diagnostics.",
          "marks": 10,
